    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should ask but my doctor is super hard to reach and i don't want to wait days for a callback just for a sinus thing. is it really that big of a deal? i've taken sudafed before with no issues. like, is there actually a known reaction or is it just a standard warning?",
